OL,3,AAnti-terror police investigate as one
OL,4,Aperson killed in shooting near Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed and four
OL,7,Fothers wounded in a gun attack in a
OL,8,FParisian suburb which police have said
OL,9,Fthey are treating as a terrorist
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,FSeveral drive-by shootings took place
OL,13,Fon Friday - first in Trappes to the
OL,14,Fsouthwest of Paris, and then nearby La
OL,15,FVerriere - and a local mayor said a
OL,16,F12-year-old girl was among the wounded.
OL,18,FFrench Prime Minister Sebastien Lecornu
OL,19,Fsaid the suspected attacker had been
OL,20,F"apprehended and placed in police
OL,21,Fcustody".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
